{
  "id": "work-assets",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Track and hand over work assets",
  "lang": "en",
  "app_version": "preprod-2026-10-12",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "start": {
    "url": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/dashboard-v2",
    "local_storage": {
      "local-translate": "en",
      "assetGridsWrapper": "false"
    }
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "external",
    "voice_id": "7jQ3jNk3Fcw65sWUmzun",
    "model_id": "eleven_v4"
  },
  "chapters": true,
  "interstitials": true,
  "thumbnail": {
    "shot": "s25",
    "title": "Work assets"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "Want to know who in your company has which laptop or phone? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and I'll show you how to track and hand over work assets.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets:text-is(\"Assets\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets:text-is(\"Assets\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "You'll find assets in the left menu, in the Company section, where I expand Assets.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets:text-is(\"Assets\")",
          "before_ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets:text-is(\"Assets\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_management",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_management",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_custom_fields",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "I click Management, and the Management of assets page opens with every asset in the company.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_management",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] tr[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=assetsManagementPage] h5:text-is(\"Management of assets\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=assets-management-add-button]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/all"
      },
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "Assets overview"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "For each asset you see the holder, with the acceptance status under their name, and next to it the inventory number and category.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] th.cdk-column-holderNameStatusFormatted",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] th.cdk-column-inventory_number",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] th.cdk-column-categories",
          "before_ms": 200
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] th.cdk-column-holderNameStatusFormatted",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/all"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "Narrow the list down with search, with the Acceptance status filter, for example to assets waiting for confirmation, or by category.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=filtersSearch]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-select button:has-text(\"Acceptance status\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-select button:has-text(\"Category\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] nb-select button:has-text(\"Acceptance status\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/all"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "The switch at the top right turns on a detailed table, which you can download with the Export to Excel button.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #users_management_toggle label",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ag-grid-angular .ag-center-cols-container .ag-row",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Export to Excel\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Export to Excel\")",
        "url_contains": "gridTypeExtended=true"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "I turn the switch off again, and with the Import button you can upload many assets at once from an Excel template.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #users_management_toggle label",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] tr[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Import\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] tr[data-cy=tableRow]",
        "url_contains": "gridTypeExtended=false"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "The orange button then reminds everyone who hasn't confirmed their asset yet to accept it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Remind all unaccepted assets\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Remind all unaccepted assets\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/all"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "I click Categories in the menu, where you set up groups of assets, such as laptops or phones, that you can then filter by.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_categories",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] tr[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Notebook\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=assetsCategoriesPage] table",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #assets_categories_add",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/categories"
      },
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "Categories and custom fields"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "You create a new category with the Add button, just give it a name and a color.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #assets_categories_add",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #assets_categories_add",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/categories"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "I click Custom fields, where you add extra details, such as the manufacturer, a size or a licence expiry date.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_custom_fields",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] tr[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Producer\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] table",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #assets_custom_fields_add",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/custom-fields"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "Each field has its own type, for example text, number, date, a choice from options, or a reminder.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] th.cdk-column-dataTypeFormatted",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] #assets_custom_fields_add",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] th.cdk-column-dataTypeFormatted",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/custom-fields"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "In the menu I click Management again, then Add, and the new asset card opens.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets_management",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] tr[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=assets-management-add-button]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetNameInput]",
          "value": "10000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetAssignHolderButton]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      },
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "A new asset"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "In the Name field I type what the asset is, here a Lenovo ThinkPad laptop.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetNameInput]",
          "value": "Lenovo ThinkPad T14 – demo",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetAcquisitionDateInput]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "The date of acquisition is prefilled with today, and for an older asset you simply change it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetAcquisitionDateInput]",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetAcquisitionDateInput]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "The inventory number is required and must be unique within the company.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetInventoryNumberInput]",
          "value": "DEMO-NB-014",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetSerialNumberInput]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "In Designation I enter the serial number, and if the asset doesn't have one, the lightning button generates a random code.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetSerialNumberInput]",
          "value": "PF-6N9S4Z",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] #assets_management_detail_asset_part_generate_code_button",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] #assets_management_detail_asset_part_generate_code_button",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "I fill in the acquisition price excluding VAT and pick euros as the currency.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetPriceInput]",
          "value": "1290",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetCurrencySelect] button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"EUR\")",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"EUR\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetCurrencySelect] button:text-is(\"EUR\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "In the Category field I tick Notebook, and with the plus button next to it you could create a new category right away.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetCategoriesSelect] input",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "Note",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:has-text(\"Notebook\")",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] #assets_management_detail_asset_part_create_new_category_button",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] #assets_management_detail_asset_part_create_new_category_button",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "With the Select button you can upload a photo of the asset, so everyone knows right away what it is.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetsPhotoUpload]",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetsPhotoUpload]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "I'll hand the asset over right away, so I click Assign this asset, and Holder information appears below.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetAssignHolderButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetNoteInput]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      },
      "part": 5,
      "part_title": "Handover to an employee"
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "As the holder I choose my colleague Olivia Brown.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete] input",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=autocompleteSearchInput]",
          "value": "Olivia",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:has-text(\"Brown Olivia\")",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete] [data-cy=autocompleteClearButton]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "I leave the asset status at New and the handover date at today.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] nb-select[formcontrolname=condition]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetHandoverDateInput]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetHandoverDateInput]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "In the note I write what Olivia gets with the laptop, because the note goes into the handover protocol.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=assetNoteInput]",
          "value": "Handed over with a charger and a bag.",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=saveFormButton]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/new/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "narration": "I click Save, and the asset is created together with its holder.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=saveFormButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetEditHolderButton]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete] input[disabled]",
        "url_contains": "/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "narration": "The holder then accepts the asset in the app with an electronic signature, or rejects it, and until then it waits for confirmation.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetsForm] [data-cy=holderAutocomplete]",
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "#assets_management_detail_holder_part_reset_acceptance_button",
        "url_contains": "/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "narration": "If they put off accepting it, the arrow button sends them the acceptance request again.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "#assets_management_detail_holder_part_reset_acceptance_button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "#assets_management_detail_holder_part_reset_acceptance_button",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "#assets_management_detail_holder_part_reset_acceptance_button",
        "url_contains": "/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s28",
      "narration": "I click the Expanded tab, where you fill in the custom fields you prepared earlier.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetDetailTabExtendedInfo] a",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"customFieldInput-Producer\"]",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] form:has([data-cy=\"customFieldInput-Producer\"])",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"customFieldInput-Producer\"]",
        "url_contains": "/extended-info"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s29",
      "narration": "I click the History tab, where you'll find the handover protocols and an audit log that records every change to the asset.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=assetDetailTabHistory] a",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] table:has-text(\"Protocol type\")",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] table:has-text(\"Protocol type\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] table:has-text(\"Protocol type\")",
        "url_contains": "/history"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s30",
      "narration": "You'll find the employee's view in the Me section of the menu, where I expand My assets and click Overview.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_assets:text-is(\"My assets\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_my_assets",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_my_assets",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=myAssetsPage] tr[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] [data-cy=myAssetsPage] [data-cy=assetAcceptButton]",
        "url_contains": "/app/assets/my/assets"
      },
      "part": 6,
      "part_title": "Acceptance and return"
    },
